 "Wipe hidden GPS, camera, and timestamp data from your photos before you share them — scanned and cleaned instantly, right in your browser, no upload to servers necessary.": "Borra los datos ocultos de GPS, cámara y fecha de tus fotos antes de compartirlas: se analizan y limpian al instante en tu navegador, sin subir nada a servidores.",
 "Word around the office is his home planet, Bonbonia": "En la oficina se dice que su planeta natal, Bonbonia",
